                  <nc xml:id="m-23ac1f03-9e5c-402e-a769-884a97f0c5f7" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-00ad4e10-4e9f-4622-b16c-e49ca803a9fb" facs="#m-503f6b87-12f6-4445-849c-46a98dfade9e" pname="a" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-f4145875-789b-4c78-86de-4a907e17be1e"><lg xml:id="m-bcfbcf14-9c13-435e-92bd-83ffc3b85915"><l xml:id="m-f2090650-6dee-423a-a1c7-c6b7054aa52b" facs="#m-921ed096-60b3-4d4e-be45-a8ff90787f32" label="ambiguous">1023E</l><l xml:id="m-671287f5-daf0-4a91-9c93-f19fb530c096" facs="#m-144dd1d9-8a7c-42f3-a316-e14fd4afe268" label="ambiguous">September. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-3b3806a8-b5f9-4bbf-a5b6-cf29e7a0080f" facs="#m-dcf4a217-cf67-46f8-a71d-f5ad95f6d3c7" label="lyrics-like">ná¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a43a6cd-bbfd-4c03-b768-c37e5e38cc67" facs="#m-6901e041-5f97-419e-8697-f75766af236a" label="lyrics-like">cu-li * gló-ri-ae tú¬ ae.</l><l xml:id="m-b3b2d7bb-2c25-4fd4-9f39-7a0f003094b4" facs="#m-72921413-18ee-494c-844c-e1c7b843a8d3" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Joannem.</l><l xml:id="m-4eca9d59-6b45-4413-a715-db9b48b7804f" facs="#m-a5710373-6ecc-41a1-a980-4afaf1d202f3" label="ambiguous">Joann. 21, 15-17.</l><l xml:id="m-d9eb9731-22a0-45fc-a982-2240c5b5ee11" facs="#m-eece5edd-b670-43b0-a318-9540baf78344" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Dixit Jesus Si- quia amo te. Dicit ei: Pasce agnos</l><l xml:id="m-dde65647-92d6-4dd0-a751-293630f415ca" facs="#m-16807bfc-a383-45d1-8435-350e1d90a6be" label="lyrics-like">L móni Petro: Simon Joánnis,</l><l xml:id="m-351974c3-1464-4483-b7e7-5a11e6f6f214" facs="#m-56fb5507-d868-4c68-a562-b9259200cd79" label="lyrics-like">meos. Dicit ei tértio: Simon Joán¬</l><l xml:id="m-f68951fb-dcca-4d51-8675-4de308019465" facs="#m-a69a2f85-d996-4fa8-98f9-6df60b2df477" label="ambiguous">diligis me plus his? Dicit ei: Etiam,</l><l xml:id="m-e18b87c4-cc33-417b-9162-e7829f12608c" facs="#m-32e71405-96ae-4bb4-885a-9a0abd8d7a9c" label="lyrics-like">nis, amas me? Contristátus est</l><l xml:id="m-b029171d-0c17-4b97-b71b-a347d5973397" facs="#m-885fc490-9c27-4cf1-a6ba-116b67805ec9" label="lyrics-like">Petrus, quia dixit ei tértio: Amas</l><l xml:id="m-9f9320de-7f3c-4c47-a0d3-92a4554c52fb" facs="#m-9cfe8126-9bf1-4261-9039-0a930d8e811d" label="lyrics-like">Dómine, tu scis quia amo te. Dicit</l><l xml:id="m-b2a64e68-a1c6-49bb-a66d-87f89d0a5a3f" facs="#m-c90c15b4-debb-49c3-bb6c-7c0437a69a51" label="lyrics-like">ei: Pasce agnos meos. Dicit eil me? et dixit ei: Dómine, tu</l><l xml:id="m-516b7aff-082b-48c5-8a9c-084312659330" facs="#m-f13612da-bc78-4332-a050-b6fddab568e3" label="lyrics-like">iterum : Simon Joánnis, diligis me? l ómnia nosti; tu scis quia amo te.</l><l xml:id="m-c3de407d-a1aa-44a8-bbcb-40dcc61b17d5" facs="#m-0c56ae35-9572-48b8-8bed-1ee14a9c5c18" label="lyrics-like">Ait illi: Etiam, Dómine, tu scis! Dixit ei: Pasce oves meas.</l><l xml:id="m-bf8fa3c7-f3b2-491e-b930-7900817f3e05" facs="#m-023aca69-70b1-4515-8d34-c0ca6a915bf3" label="ambiguous">orert.!</l><l xml:id="m-e31e28b6-d608-40b6-9eb8-7bb9eb75f379" facs="#m-4b88951d-6236-49ae-9ad1-82571427b046" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-4f3b54d6-8b5f-4a69-93de-101f29e82041" facs="#m-025c4bd3-c2d6-427e-a40c-0fcf46f621be" label="ambiguous">Y</l><l xml:id="m-89c63ebb-e6b7-4f10-885f-06e7292e64a3" facs="#m-60a722a3-dae0-40b9-b3d8-144b2c1c0bd5" label="lyrics-like">Eni-te,“ fí¬</l><l xml:id="m-13cc7e15-ddb8-4cac-b325-1bb139fcd027" facs="#m-c8bd7f03-94e9-42f2-9475-2f3e57162982" label="lyrics-like">li- i, audí¬</l><l xml:id="m-d8f6d5f2-eec2-41f3-adec-1273c4bd3051" facs="#m-b48ba9c7-0ec5-49fc-b5c5-18af6da10a8a" label="ambiguous">te</l><l xml:id="m-ffcc64d1-4e13-418c-b190-339dc8512017" facs="#m-361f6d3f-96dd-4ebc-8507-6b823fd1c384" label="lyrics-like">Dó- mi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-8547e159-2ece-4089-8998-c5c8f29c7b79" facs="#m-539da82c-d6bc-44ab-a23f-e90360c5c4df" label="lyrics-like">ti¬ mó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e27c94d-6d96-43d6-b7c9-ce367e5e04ae" facs="#m-81f6d3dc-95cf-4cb3-887c-aa48175a5909" label="lyrics-like">do-cé¬</l><l xml:id="m-95c5f72e-01ab-4194-9d11-da3dea51ce17" facs="#m-d5af78a1-b943-4821-932d-7e5717e8254c" label="ambiguous">rem</l><l xml:id="m-c0ca9301-18e1-43d0-8966-c65269c16184" facs="#m-1567aadd-35b4-4ce7-9785-00b85ad0f691" label="ambiguous">me:</l><l xml:id="m-7e94758e-6d21-4b98-ab84-e53aee555e32" facs="#m-70a0e5c7-e044-4d87-9bdf-9f68c76f8b33" label="ambiguous">bo</l><l xml:id="m-cda06fd3-6b0f-43d2-9487-322aeec0469d" facs="#m-6606eb5c-95c7-4674-9384-c9bb13321456" label="ambiguous">vos.</l><l xml:id="m-568084e1-b952-4227-a5cd-710bd081787f" facs="#m-6c8eaad4-a213-4910-810d-4977b0fd85a7" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-41a43992-f0fb-44e1-9398-b0201d93d9ea" facs="#m-dc5cb366-9582-4196-bc04-efcce65d9c0c" label="lyrics-like">Blatiónibus nostris, quaésumus, dénte, sincéris tractémus obséquiis</l><l xml:id="m-d3896b36-ddfb-4f34-84e5-d2760be9b1f7" facs="#m-6bae394a-3e3d-4f3a-a6ae-30732e681277" label="lyrics-like">U Dómine, benigne suscéptis, dal et fidéli mente sumámus. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-9f52bce5-b366-4db5-ac6d-00629daff62c" facs="#m-94da8f92-9f84-43e3-b102-71a055a2d169" label="lyrics-like">nobis, ut haec divína mystéria,</l><l xml:id="m-111bc1b1-fa0a-45c9-a094-02f952daebb4" facs="#m-6fcd9bab-2439-464f-a7ee-5ce72040f3ff" label="ambiguous">minum nostrum Jesum Christum</l><l xml:id="m-c600b750-cda0-4cf5-83d5-4c842d4ec3cd" facs="#m-85fd947b-0f36-4acf-8830-dec85bd068a9" label="lyrics-like">sancto Pio Summo Pontífice interce-Filium tuum.</l><l xml:id="m-fee717c7-c054-4d0a-98c7-4b99920d895f" facs="#m-b598fb8f-d767-45bf-bc78-12a45abb46ae" label="ambiguous">Common preface, p. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-a9974192-b9c8-4429-8faa-1d19b89f9f78" facs="#m-a2b97c32-839d-4ff7-9959-66dd7e62d320" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-7895319a-109f-4ba6-aca2-40196dfa463a" facs="#m-732b1f39-8536-46b5-97a8-48f459f25362" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-673d30dc-6901-4715-bec0-0b6a1fb0e035" facs="#m-0c03bec8-4d2a-41e5-801c-6f637cc4f2fb" label="lyrics-like">Aro mé¬ a “vé-re est cí-bus, et sánguis mé¬ us</l><l xml:id="m-0417baed-1bae-4240-9b3e-abec14f1feec" facs="#m-47178ba3-1de7-4bd4-8cc3-e181cad387f4" label="lyrics-like">vé-re est pó¬ tus. Qui mandúcat mé-am cár- nem et</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
